16. Tricky Interview Questions:
Q1. Why Map is not part of Collection?
➡ It stores key-value pairs, not individual elements.

Q2. Difference between List and Set?
➡ List allows duplicates, Set does not.

Q3. When to use TreeMap?
➡ When sorted keys are required.

Q4. How HashMap works internally?
➡ Uses hashing, buckets, linked list/tree (Java 8).

Q5. Which collection is thread-safe?
➡ Hashtable, ConcurrentHashMap.
